{"book":11,"chapter":36,"rubric":"MODERN FRONTEND / YOUR OWN MINI-FRAMEWORK / CHAPTER 28","slides":[{"title":"Interface as a function","sub":"Chapter 36 · Reactivity","short":"Intro","main":"UI = f(state): reactivity itself ties data changes to view updates.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["By hand","UI = f(state)","What we build"],"captions":["Updating each element by hand is tedious: some forgotten, some updated twice","State changed — the interface recomputes itself, only the needed part","Signals, effects, computed, batch and cleanup — a core in dozens of lines"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["state.count = 5;","el1.textContent = state.count;","el2.textContent = state.count * 2;","// forgot el3 …"],"hl":[1,2],"lang":"js","size":9.5,"lh":24.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":70.0,"y":80.0,"w":90.0,"h":36.0,"text":"state","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":118.0,"y1":80.0,"x2":152.0,"y2":80.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"u","x":220.0,"y":80.0,"w":100.0,"h":36.0,"text":"interface","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":126.0,"text":"UI = f(state)","size":10.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":65.0,"y":60.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"signal","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":60.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"effect","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":295.0,"y":60.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"computed","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":120.0,"y":104.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"batch","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"e~cell","x":240.0,"y":104.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"cleanup","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[14.5,29.0]}]},{"title":"Subscriptions","sub":"Observer","short":"Subscriptions","main":"Observer: a source keeps a list of subscribers and notifies them on change.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Store","subscribe","By hand"],"captions":["A store holds a value and a list of subscribers","subscribe(fn) adds and returns an unsubscribe function; set calls everyone","Who subscribes to what, and when to unsubscribe, is up to the programmer"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":40.0,"text":"store\nvalue = 1","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":270.0,"y":40.0,"w":90.0,"h":24.0,"text":"subscriber A","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":100.0,"w":90.0,"h":24.0,"text":"subscriber B","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":140.0,"y1":62.0,"x2":224.0,"y2":44.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":140.0,"y1":78.0,"x2":224.0,"y2":96.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["const off = store.subscribe(v => render(v));","store.set(2);   // → render(2)","off();"],"hl":[0,1,2],"lang":"js","size":9.5,"lh":24.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":150.0,"h":36.0,"text":"subscribed by hand\nand forgot to unsubscribe","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":150.0,"h":36.0,"text":"signals subscribe\nautomatically","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[12.5,25.0]}]},{"title":"Signal","sub":"A value with subscription","short":"Signal","main":"signal(v) is a getter function with a set method; a read inside an effect records a dependency.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["signal","Reading records","set wakes"],"captions":["const count = signal(0): read count(), write count.set(1)","A read inside an effect puts the effect among the signal's subscribers","set with a new value wakes everyone; the same value — nothing happens"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["const count = signal(0);","count();        // 0","count.set(1);","count();        // 1"],"hl":[0,1,2],"lang":"js","size":10.0,"lh":24.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"e","x":90.0,"y":80.0,"w":100.0,"h":36.0,"text":"effect","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":142.0,"y1":80.0,"x2":188.0,"y2":80.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":270.0,"y":80.0,"w":110.0,"h":36.0,"text":"count\nsubscribers: [effect]","tone":"green","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":126.0,"text":"read → subscription","size":9.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":110.0,"h":36.0,"text":"set(1)\n0 → 1","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e~line","x1":146.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":194.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"e","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":110.0,"h":36.0,"text":"effect\nran","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":120.0,"text":"set(1) again — silence","tone":"yellow","size":9.5}]],"cues":[13.1,26.1]}]},{"title":"Effect","sub":"Automatic tracking","short":"Effect","main":"effect(fn) runs fn at once and reruns it when any signal it read changes.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Runs at once","Current observer","Rerun"],"captions":["effect(fn) runs fn immediately and remembers what fn read","Before running, an effect writes itself to a global variable; a signal looks there on read","Any change to the signals it read reruns the effect"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["const count = signal(0);","effect(() => console.log(count()));","// → 0"],"hl":[1,2],"lang":"js","size":10.0,"lh":24.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["let current = null;","function effect(fn) {","  const run = () => { current = run; fn(); current = null; };","  run();","}"],"hl":[0,2],"lang":"js","size":9.0,"lh":19.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["count.set(1);   // → 1","count.set(2);   // → 2","count.set(2);   // (silence)"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"js","size":10.0,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[13.7,27.3]}]},{"title":"Computed values","sub":"computed","short":"computed","main":"computed(fn) is a derived value: lazy, cached, recomputed when sources change.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Derived","Lazy","Cache"],"captions":["fullName = computed(() => first() + \" \" + last()) — reads signals and acts as a signal itself","Until somebody reads it, nothing is computed","The result is cached until the sources change"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":50.0,"y":40.0,"w":70.0,"h":28.0,"text":"first","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":50.0,"y":100.0,"w":70.0,"h":28.0,"text":"last","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":190.0,"y":70.0,"w":70.0,"h":28.0,"text":"fullName","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":320.0,"y":70.0,"w":70.0,"h":28.0,"text":"effect","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":86.0,"y1":46.0,"x2":154.0,"y2":62.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":86.0,"y1":94.0,"x2":154.0,"y2":78.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e3","x1":226.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":284.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["const total = computed(() => items().length * price());","// computations: 0","total();   // computations: 1"],"hl":[1,2],"lang":"js","size":9.0,"lh":24.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["total();   // from cache","total();   // from cache","price.set(5);","total();   // recomputed"],"hl":[0,1,3],"lang":"js","size":10.0,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[12.7,25.4]}]},{"title":"Dynamic dependencies","sub":"Resubscribe","short":"Dynamic","main":"Before each run an effect unsubscribes and resubscribes — to what it actually read.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Branching","Rebuild","Savings"],"captions":["effect(() => on() ? a() : b()): the set of signals read depends on the condition","Before each run subscriptions are cleared and collected again during the run","An unreachable branch no longer wakes the effect"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["effect(() => {","  if (mode()) show(a());","  else show(b());","});"],"hl":[1,2],"lang":"js","size":10.0,"lh":24.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"e","x":90.0,"y":80.0,"w":90.0,"h":34.0,"text":"effect","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"m","x":270.0,"y":40.0,"w":80.0,"h":24.0,"text":"mode ✓","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":270.0,"y":80.0,"w":80.0,"h":24.0,"text":"a ✓","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":120.0,"w":80.0,"h":24.0,"text":"b ✗","tone":"muted","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":136.0,"y1":74.0,"x2":230.0,"y2":44.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":136.0,"y1":80.0,"x2":230.0,"y2":80.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":50.0,"text":"mode = false → now we read b","size":10.0},{"t":"cell","id":"m","x":270.0,"y":90.0,"w":80.0,"h":24.0,"text":"mode ✓","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":270.0,"y":120.0,"w":80.0,"h":24.0,"text":"a ✗","tone":"muted","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":150.0,"y":120.0,"w":80.0,"h":24.0,"text":"b ✓","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[13.4,26.8]}]},{"title":"Diamond dependencies","sub":"Glitches","short":"Diamond","main":"Order matters: all intermediate values first, then the consumer — no \"glitches\".","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Diamond","Glitch","Mark, then compute"],"captions":["Two computeds depend on one signal, a third on both","Naive: A recomputed, consumer ran, B still old — a \"glitch\"","Mark everything affected first, then recompute on demand: the consumer runs once"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":180.0,"y":24.0,"w":70.0,"h":28.0,"text":"s","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":100.0,"y":76.0,"w":70.0,"h":28.0,"text":"A","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":260.0,"y":76.0,"w":70.0,"h":28.0,"text":"B","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":180.0,"y":128.0,"w":70.0,"h":28.0,"text":"C = A + B","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":160.0,"y1":38.0,"x2":118.0,"y2":62.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":200.0,"y1":38.0,"x2":242.0,"y2":62.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e3","x1":118.0,"y1":90.0,"x2":160.0,"y2":114.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e4","x1":242.0,"y1":90.0,"x2":200.0,"y2":114.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":120.0,"h":30.0,"text":"A = 2 (new)","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":120.0,"h":30.0,"text":"B = 1 (old)","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":180.0,"y":112.0,"w":200.0,"h":30.0,"text":"C = 3: inconsistent ✗","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":56.0,"w":120.0,"h":26.0,"text":"A, B: stale","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":180.0,"y1":56.0,"x2":180.0,"y2":80.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":104.0,"w":220.0,"h":30.0,"text":"C reads A, B → both fresh, one run","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[13.0,26.1]}]},{"title":"Batched updates","sub":"batch","short":"batch","main":"batch groups several writes: effects run once after, not after each.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Three writes","batch","One run"],"captions":["Without grouping: three writes — three runs, two with incomplete state","batch postpones running effects until the passed function ends","The set of pending effects is cleared, each runs once"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["a.set(1);   // effect #1","b.set(2);   // effect #2","c.set(3);   // effect #3"],"hl":[0,1,2],"lang":"js","size":10.0,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["batch(() => {","  a.set(1);","  b.set(2);","  c.set(3);","});   // → one run"],"hl":[0,4],"lang":"js","size":10.0,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"q","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":150.0,"h":36.0,"text":"queue: {effect}\nafter batch","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":168.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":192.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"r","x":280.0,"y":70.0,"w":140.0,"h":36.0,"text":"effect: once","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[13.1,26.1]}]},{"title":"Cleanup and lifetime","sub":"dispose and cleanup","short":"Cleanup","main":"An effect returns a cleanup function; dispose unsubscribes from all sources.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["cleanup","dispose","Scope"],"captions":["An effect returns a cleanup function: called before a rerun and on removal","dispose() unsubscribes from all sources and calls the last cleanup","A scope releases all effects created inside it with one call"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["effect(() => {","  const t = setInterval(tick, 1000);","  return () => clearInterval(t);   // cleanup","});"],"hl":[1,2],"lang":"js","size":9.5,"lh":24.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["const stop = effect(() => { … });","…","stop();   // unsubscribe + cleanup"],"hl":[2],"lang":"js","size":10.0,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":180.0,"y":40.0,"w":120.0,"h":28.0,"text":"scope","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":100.0,"w":80.0,"h":26.0,"text":"effect 1","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":100.0,"w":80.0,"h":26.0,"text":"effect 2","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":270.0,"y":100.0,"w":80.0,"h":26.0,"text":"effect 3","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":150.0,"y1":54.0,"x2":108.0,"y2":88.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":180.0,"y1":54.0,"x2":180.0,"y2":88.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e3","x1":210.0,"y1":54.0,"x2":252.0,"y2":88.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6}]],"cues":[13.7,27.3]}]},{"title":"Equality and mutation","sub":"What counts as a change","short":"Equality","main":"A signal compares values like Object.is: an in-place object mutation goes unnoticed.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Object.is","Mutation is invisible","New array"],"captions":["A signal wakes subscribers only if Object.is(old, new) is false","items().push(x): same reference — nothing happened","set([...items(), x]) — new reference: effects run; you can set your own equals"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["Object.is(1, 1)         // true  → silence","Object.is(1, 2)         // false → run","Object.is(NaN, NaN)     // true"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"js","size":9.5,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["const items = signal([]);","items().push(\"a\");   // reference unchanged ✗","// interface not updated"],"hl":[1],"bad":[1],"lang":"js","size":9.5,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["items.set([...items(), \"a\"]);   // ✓","const s = signal(1, { equals: (a, b) => a === b });"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"js","size":9.0,"lh":30.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[13.5,26.9]}]},{"title":"Proxy reactivity","sub":"The Vue approach","short":"Proxy","main":"Proxy intercepts field reads and writes: track on get, trigger on set.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Traps","track and trigger","Proxy traps"],"captions":["Proxy wraps an object: get and set intercept field reads and writes","get → track(field): effect depends on the field; set → trigger(field): wake the field's subscribers","Destructuring and copies lose the link; a proxy is not equal to the original"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["const state = reactive({ count: 0 });","effect(() => log(state.count));   // reads a field","state.count++;                    // writes a field"],"hl":[1,2],"lang":"js","size":9.0,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["get(obj, key) { track(obj, key); return obj[key]; },","set(obj, key, v) { obj[key] = v; trigger(obj, key); return true; }"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"js","size":8.5,"lh":30.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":150.0,"h":36.0,"text":"const { count } = state\n— reactivity lost","tone":"red","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":150.0,"h":36.0,"text":"state === raw\n→ false","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[12.8,25.5]}]},{"title":"Async and errors","sub":"Races and failures","short":"Async","main":"Take an async result only from the latest request; an effect's error must not break the others.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Request race","Last one wins","Errors and fuse"],"captions":["An old response arrives later than the new one and overwrites it","Remember the last request number and ignore stale ones","Catch an effect's error and pass it to a handler; a write loop into its own source — stop at a limit"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"request id=1","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":90.0,"y":110.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"request id=2","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"response 1 — later ✗","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":270.0,"y":110.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"response 2 — earlier","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["let last = 0;","effect(async () => {","  const n = ++last, id = userId();","  const data = await load(id);","  if (n === last) result.set(data);   // fresh","});"],"hl":[2,4],"lang":"js","size":9.0,"lh":19.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["effect(() => {","  try { riskyWork(); } catch (e) { onError(e); }","});","// effect changes what it reads → at most 100 repeats"],"hl":[1,3],"lang":"js","size":9.0,"lh":24.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[13.5,27.0]}]},{"title":"Summary","sub":"Reactivity","short":"Summary","main":"Signals, effects and computed — the core of a reactive framework in dozens of lines.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Core","Subtleties","Next"],"captions":["Subscriptions, signal, effect, computed — dependencies are collected on read","Diamond, batch, cleanup, equality, proxies, races and errors","Next topic — templates and a virtual DOM on top of this core"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":65.0,"y":60.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"signal","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":60.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"effect","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":295.0,"y":60.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"computed","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":65.0,"y":60.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"diamond, batch","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":60.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"cleanup","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":295.0,"y":60.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"Object.is, Proxy","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":20.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["h(\"ul\", null,","  h(\"li\", null, \"a\"),","  h(\"li\", null, \"b\"))"],"hl":[0,1,2],"lang":"js","size":11.0,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[15.2,30.3]}]}]}